#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "About &showfoto;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&showfoto; is a fast Image Editor with powerful image editing tools. You can "
"use it to view your photographs and improve them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reporting Bugs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&showfoto; is an Open Source project. This means that it relies on its users "
"to play their part by, at least, reporting problems and suggesting possible "
"improvements."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&showfoto; makes it as easy as possible for you to report bugs or suggest "
"improvements. Wherever you are in the application the Help menu will include "
"a Report Bugs option. This will display a message box with a highlighted "
"link. Click on the link and your web browser will open the page for the "
"reporting system. All the information required will already be filled in, "
"just follow the instructions for completing your report."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Support"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&showfoto; is a community supported project, which means that users and "
"developers support one another. If you become a regular user of &showfoto; "
"you are encouraged to join the &showfoto; Users Mailing List. You can start "
"off by asking questions of other &showfoto; users and hopefully soon you "
"will be answering the support questions of others."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "&showfoto; Users Mailing List joining instructions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also visit the <ulink url=\"http://www.digikam.org\">&digikam-app; "
"Home Page.</ulink> for news of new releases and other &showfoto; related "
"information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Involved"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are many ways that you can get involved with the continued development "
"of &showfoto;. You do not need to be a software developer. You can help with "
"documentation, translation and user interface design or just contribute "
"really good ideas to the wish-list. You can also get involved by testing "
"early development code as it is being developed and providing feedback to "
"the developers. Of course, if you are a software developer then you can help "
"to make &showfoto; the best digital photograph application there is."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The best way to start getting involved with &showfoto; is to join the "
"Developers Mailing List. <ulink url=\"https://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/"
"digikam-devel\">&showfoto; Developer Mailing List joining instructions.</"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""

